  "prose": [
    {
      "title": "Active",
      "text": "Set `active` prop to add active styles to `NavLink`.\n\nNote that if you're using a React Router or Remix `NavLink` inside `renderRoot`, the active styles will be based on the\n[`aria-current` attribute that's set by React Router](https://reactrouter.com/en/main/components/nav-link#aria-current)\nso you won't need to explicitly set the `active` prop.\n\nYou can customize active styles with `color` and `variant` props:",
      "format": "md"
    },
    {
      "title": "Nested NavLinks",
      "text": "To create nested links put `NavLink` as children of another `NavLink`:\n\n  defaultElement=\"a\"\n  changeToElement=\"button\"\n  component=\"NavLink\"\n  withNext\n/>",
      "format": "md"
    }
  ],
